        "sid": "JHN 17"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "17",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yesu axweesanaywí ooaro nguwa hhe'eés, iri qaytsiít gawaá doori, iri oó', «Baabá, qooma naa hardát. Garmaawók xirfayeeseek, as Garmaawók kuúng uwa xirfayeesi sleeme, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "adoodá' kuúng Garma kura aleesleemuú i hanís daanduú muu sleémeerowo, asma sleémeero kudá' taa dirós i hanís ngiwa slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl i haniisi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee slafíngw alhhe'eesay wásl an kwí, kuúng uwa xuiya', Munguúduú ló', kudá' wák, nee Yesu Kristo, kudá' naa ya/áp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án kuúng ugwa xirfayeés baraaká' yaamuwo, nee gadiyeédá' naa hanís, aga hhe'eés tleehhamooro. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám daxta Baabá, án kuúng na xirfayeesáng amoorók wa ale, ar xirfuudá' ni amoorók wa koom iimír yaamu kiwa tleehhiiká.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Án kuúng ugwa xu'utís dír mukdá' naa hanís baraaká' yaamuwo. Inooín a mukók, nguri aníng i hanís, nee axweesantók kaa óh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nee hám kaa xuú' daxta adór tidá' sleémeero naa aníng hanís, amór i dahh tar amoorók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma axweesanaydá' naa aníng i ó', aníng ugwa dir'íní oó', nee inooín kwaa ya/án, kari ló'wa xuú' adór amór i dahhi tar amoorók, kari haratlintií' adór án heé iga ya/aaw tar kuúng.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Án kuká' in aleefiririím. Aníng múk aa haratlintii'iiká u aleefiririimaaká, ala a kuká' kuúng naa aníng i hanís, asma a kók. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kwe'eé' sleémeero a kók, nee kók a kwe'eé'. Nee aníng taa xirfayeés baraaín wa ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a baraaká' yaamií diriiaaká, ala inooín ta baraaká' yaamií dirii'. Aníng ni hardáh amoorók. Baabuú hhoohhoó', kuká' na xuumeek ar /uuruú umuuwók kudá' naa aníng i hanís. As wakleeli'iima kawa kon, adoodá' atén kar koomaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Qoomár án niwa dinkwár i dirii' nee inooín, aníng iga xuúm ar /uuruú umuuwók kudá' naa hanís, ngiri amohhe'eemiís. Ala tam baraaine heé wák aa qwaar i kaahh, aqo har heedá' taa qwanáy i harafaár iimír iimu/uungo, as Gooi iwa bo/. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala án hamí ni hardáh amoorók. Nee /aymi'iiká' aníng in baraaká' yaamuú wa káh, as qwal/uueé' masók i boo/ baraaine. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án axweesantók aga dir'íní oó', nee inooín muu gaa aáhh asma inooín awa yaamuuwooká, adoodá' án tar heé yaamuuwooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a fiririimaaká as inooín kiwa hinges baraaká' yaamuwo, ala kiwa xuun dír kudá' tlaakwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín awa yaamuuwooká, adoodá' án tar heé yaamuuwooká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuúng na hheehhe'eeseek ar looeemadá'. Axweesantók a looeema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adoodá' án kuúng ira ya/áp baraakaáká' yaamu, án sleeme inooín ina ya/aáw baraakaá yaamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala aníng ti amoorók i haniís as inooín, as inooín sleeme tawa kók tleehhiti ló'wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Ala awa án ni aleefiriiriim a kuká' kilooineeká, ala tam kudá' aníng i haratlintiiá' as axweesantaín. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inooín sleémeero masók a wákleeli adoodá' kuúng Baabá tar baraaeé' i diri', nee án nir baraawók i dirii'. Inooín sleeme masók i baraarén, as múk aa haratlintii'iiká ngi tsaahhi adór kuúng tar kudá' aníng iga ya/ap. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Xirfuudá' kuúng naa aníng i hanís, aníng ugwa dir'íní haniís kudá' aníng iga haratlinti'iye', asma tawa wákleeli adoodár atén tar wákleeli, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aníng baraaín, nee kuúng baraaeé', as wakleeli'iima kawa boo/eesi. Asma múk aa haratlintii'iiká ngiwa tsaahhi adór án kuúng ira ya/áp, nee adór kuúng mukdá' aníng iga haratlintii' kur slá', adoodá' aníng ira slá'.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "«Baabá, kuká' kuúng naa hanís, gár ni slaa', masók i dinkwa nee aníng didá' án ni diriia. Nee xirfuudá' naa aní hanís nguwa ga/aya'. Asma án kuúng ina slá' iimír yaamu kiwa tleehhiiká. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Baabuú gan'amuú koóm, muu kuúng ugwa xuiiká. Ala án kuúng ugwa xuú', nee kuká' ngaa xuiyé' adór án kuúng ira ya/áp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JHN 17:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Án kuúng ugwa dir'íní xu'utís, slám u malé xu'utís, as sla'aaridá' án kuúng ira slá', masók i baraaín, nee aníng sleeme masók a baraaín.»",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JHN.17.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JHN.17.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
